# 從頭再嚟
(pos:動詞短語)
<explanation>
yue:由頭開始再做一次；重新開始
eng:to start over again; to start from scratch
<eg>
yue:今次失敗咗唔緊要，我哋從頭再嚟過。 (gam1 ci3 sat1 baai6 zo2 m4 gan2 jiu3, ngo5 dei6 cung4 tau4 zoi3 lai4 gwo3.)
eng:It doesn't matter that we failed this time; let's start over again.
</eg>
<eg>
yue:呢份計劃要從頭再嚟，之前做嘅嘢都唔啱。 (ni1 fan6 gai3 waak6 jiu3 cung4 tau4 zoi3 lai4, zi1 cin4 zou6 ge3 je5 dou1 m4 ngaam1.)
eng:This plan needs to be redone from scratch; everything done before is wrong.
</eg> [end of text]


